{"c":[{"id":"ba0aa6b7bbe93407","sum":"1.5.4 no vss: HNSW blocks writes; DROP INDEX in-txn first. orphans if crash; top-k may be short, no error; ties: harness id. No Hub filter after load. Backup warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb spares .bak. pytest+torch leaks nanobind. zstd at v1.2.0+; mem Uncompressed; no ALTER.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c478d1d3f328d8fa","sum":"1.5.4 no vss: HNSW blocks embeddings writes, even no-match; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction first. Crash leaves orphans; top-k may be short, never an error. Ties break by harness, then id. SET enable_progress_bar = false. Remove Hub filter after model load (2.0.0 nanobind).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"31075c4daaf75233","sum":"1.5.4, no vss: INSERT/DELETE fails on HNSW (unknown index type), even no-match; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop before writes (2026-10-22). No orphan guard: per-statement commits can leave orphans until next ingest or embed; top-k may be short, never an error.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T131311Z-ed378e2bb230c4e6","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 without vss on a file with the HNSW index: every INSERT or DELETE on embeddings fails (Cannot bind index, unknown index type HNSW), even a no-match delete; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop the index before any write. Measured 2026-10-22.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T134653Z-aa09ea6b143ae13d","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: exact semantic search has no orphan guard. write_session commits each statement separately, so an ingest crash can leave orphan embeddings until the next ingest or embed; a top-k search may then be short, never an error.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"584c14263b4266e5","sum":"Identical vectors are common (150 at distance 0), so exact search breaks top-k ties by harness, then id. SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse DuckDB query stdout. 2.0.0 embed/semantic leaks nanobind at exit: the Hub filter pins stockroom.embed; remove it after model load.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T175949Z-e9f28fbf7dbe5041","text":"2026-10-22: live data has many identical vectors (one query: 150 owners at distance 0), so top-k ties at the cut are common; exact semantic breaks them by harness, then id. DuckDB Python draws a progress bar on stdout for long queries; SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T183706Z-584e9a2f3117f291","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 nanobind 'leaked instances' at exit of embed/semantic: stockroom's own HF Hub logger filter (_DropUnauthenticatedHubWarning) stays on the logger for the process; its class pins stockroom.embed globals, so duckdb. Removing it after model load: no warning (2026-10-22).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3c4fa613bace7a79","sum":"Backups: warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb spares .bak. Pytest+torch nanobind leaks (none if no torch; embed/semantic none). Inverse skips: CLI if installed, doctor.py:205 if loaded; pytest -rs. zstd fails v1.0.0/v1.1.0, ok v1.2.0+; mem Uncompressed; no ALTER. schema-0 12288B.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7848f6afe9cf5adb","sum":"Stockroom backups are warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb, so delete-if-present never removes a user's .bak. Pytest that imports torch in-process prints nanobind leaks at exit; code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic: none after the Hub-filter fix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T194525Z-96009f5f2a711415","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: every warehouse backup stockroom or its contributors make is named warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb in the stockroom home (M2: warehouse.issue147-pre-duckdb2.duckdb), so later delete-if-present code removes only ours, never a user's own .bak.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T202007Z-8202b18ddd62b1e1","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: a pytest process that loads the engine conftest and imports torch in-process (importorskip) prints nanobind leaked-instance lines at exit; exit code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic subprocesses: none after the Hub-filter fix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ace2c55b4ea657f","sum":"Inverse torch skips: CLI skips when torch is installed, doctor.py:205 when loaded. Skip counts do not prove they ran; use pytest -rs. DuckDB 2 zstd fails on v1.0.0/v1.1.0, works from v1.2.0; memory stores Uncompressed. No ALTER. v2.1.2 schema-0 leftover is a bare 12288-byte file.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T230859Z-f3b33970b7939cf9","text":"Engine suite has inverse torch skips: test_doctor_cli.py:54 skips when torch is installed, test_doctor.py:205 when torch is already loaded in the worker. Skip counts do not prove torch-gated tests ran; use pytest -rs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001340Z-97dfabc9146bc1fb","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: USING COMPRESSION zstd raises BinderException on v1.0.0 and v1.1.0 files, works from v1.2.0; in-memory accepts it (stores Uncompressed). No ALTER sets compression. v2.1.2's schema-0 leftover is a bare 12,288-byte file, no tables.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b212d5b88bf00a6a","sum":"SQL immutable, comments OK. 0003 shipped; no unrun version; 0009 drops index. 2nd connect: ConnectionException. v1.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads+writes. 2.0.0 no vss: CHECKPOINT on HNSW fatal; close. Rename under flock. 3-8: 1.5.4 vss. No view-SQL; tables+constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1b02788402b8b346","sum":"storage_compatibility_version, even latest: 2nd plain in-process connect: ConnectionException. v1.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads+writes. ce16489 no nanobind. SQL immutable; 0003 as shipped; no unrun version. INSTALL/LOAD vss, no autoload; kill after 0003: no vss; 0009 drops index","tree":{"c":[{"id":"63ba1e5d1c252753","sum":"2.0.0: explicit storage_compatibility_version (even latest) raises ConnectionException on a second plain in-process connect. v1.0.0 at v2.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads and writes it. plain 489 MiB, zstd 290 MiB; ILIKE 142/196 ms; sum(length) 27/97 ms; 50 rows 3 ms; copy 5.3 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T001340Z-ee4e725d1cf8c7b2","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: any explicit storage_compatibility_version (even 'latest') makes a plain connect to the same path in the same process raise ConnectionException. A v1.0.0 file opened with 'v2.0.0' keeps v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 still reads and writes it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001341Z-996aef6d584dc9d1","text":"Live tables copied 2026-10-22 into v2.0.0 files: plain 489 MiB (text Uncompressed), zstd on text+tool_input 290 MiB. ILIKE over text 142 vs 196 ms, sum(length(text)) 27 vs 97 ms, latest 50 rows 3 ms both. Copy 5.3 s both.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"888f9caf1291b966","sum":"Puck ce16489 exited 0: make sync, no --with; copy stayed v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 wrote; no nanobind. Released SQL is immutable; 0003 returns shipped; no runner records a version unrun. 2.0.0: 0003 needs INSTALL/LOAD vss, no autoload; kill after 0003 reopens without vss; 0009 drops index.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T010854Z-5c910d697bfc5d76","text":"Puck shadow of constrain-size-as-best-we-can at ce16489 (fresh clone, make sync, no --with) exited 0: every phase passed, copy stayed v1.0.0+, DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it, no nanobind line.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T012807Z-7941fa66d7075fa2","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: released migrations are never rewritten; 0003 returns as shipped. No runner rule may record a version unrun. DuckDB 2.0.0: released 0003 needs explicit INSTALL/LOAD vss (no autoload); a kill after 0003 reopens without vss and 0009 drops the index.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4b8f31e9a70ffcd2","sum":"SQL immutable, comments OK, ci strips vs tag. 2.0.0 no vss: CHECKPOINT after ALTER/INSERT/CREATE VIEW on HNSW fatal; close. 0004-0009 reach 9. New warehouse renamed under flock, not hard-linked. 3-8: 1.5.4 vss. No view-SQL compare (v1 fewer parens); table SQL+constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"176e1e47f3b7f3ae","sum":"comments may change (#128 @rel, 0001+0007); SQL must not. make ci compares comments-stripped SQL to the latest tag. 2.0.0 no vss, HNSW: CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW: FatalException; close checkpoints. 0004-0009, mid-chain kill, tiny checkpoint_threshold reach 9.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T040809Z-c22f9b609db9aad0","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: a released migration may gain or change comments (#128 added @rel lines to 0001 and 0007); its SQL may never change to do something materially different. A make ci/CI gate compares released migrations' SQL, comments stripped, to the latest tag.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T042410Z-e369216e79b70d78","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 without vss, file with the HNSW index (2026-10-22): explicit CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW raises FatalException (Cannot bind index); a plain close checkpoints fine. Runner 0004-0009, a kill mid-chain, tiny checkpoint_threshold: all reach 9.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"906dad0df1fa4bd0","sum":"New warehouse is renamed into place under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 tests use DuckDB 1.5.4 vss files. v1.0.0 view SQL has one fewer closing paren than v2.0.0; do not compare view SQL text. Table SQL and constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T141155Z-466f715437dd59f5","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a new warehouse is built at a temp name and renamed into place after a check under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 migrate tests use files written by DuckDB 1.5.4 and its vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T143437Z-5511efe16b6ad9f6","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-23: a v1.0.0 file reloads view SQL (duckdb_views().sql) with one fewer closing paren than memory or a v2.0.0 file shows for the same view; table SQL and constraints match. A v1.0.0-vs-v2.0.0 catalog check must not compare view SQL text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
